# First run on a machine that already uses Claude Code: adopting ~/.claude.
Source docs/demo/shared/style.tape
Output docs/media/first-run.gif

Hide
Type 'export HOME="$DEMO_FRESH" PATH="$DEMO_BIN:$PATH" PS1="$ "' Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "billy" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3s

# keep the suggested name
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

# share skills, commands, agents and CLAUDE.md: yes
Enter
Sleep 3.5s
